"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"OEOpxiewgI7Sr2de0LVuMg","review_id":"MaOZyiYICadPrvvAu0-zLQ","date":"2015-10-01T13:36:20","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9426071047782898,"text_excerpt":"I sometimes have random cravings for crepes during the night and a quick yelp search directed me to Crepes a la Cart. Decided to give this place a try. This place is a small short on the corner which can easily be missed. They have a large selection of crepes which range from savory to sweet. I decided to order the Greek. The Greek: Really delicious and tons of meat and sauce. The crepe is pretty big in size and the texture of the crepe was perfect (crispy edges with chewy center) Overall, the service is pretty good and they take credit cards. Only minus is that they always run out of ingredients especially strawberries and bananas. I understand that the shop is small so it's hard to stoc..."},{"business_id":"OEOpxiewgI7Sr2de0LVuMg","review_id":"uwO7kHTr2dE8Y-xOlYK5PA","date":"2017-11-07T14:33:30","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9417014718055725,"text_excerpt":"I had just finished an exam and decided it was time to try this place out because I have a friend who works here. I prepared myself for what it would look like because she had described it to me as \"ratchet but the crepes are good.\" Sure enough, don't expect a sit down restaurant when you go here - it's tiny/cramped so I can only imagine what it's like when the boot is poppin!! The service was kind of slow, there was only one person working there though so I don't blame them. As for the Crêpes? Definitely what I needed to make me feel better after a hard exam. I got the chicken Florentine and the heavenly chocolate delight. They were pretty good! The crepe mix they make is very good I'm o..."},{"business_id":"OEOpxiewgI7Sr2de0LVuMg","review_id":"sDGkV7g0BwLoozxFjFg3dw","date":"2012-05-29T00:50:18","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9368102550506592,"text_excerpt":"This place was mentioned in Esquire Magazine as having one of the Best Breakfasts In America. I've only had the crepes from here for breakfast once, but as a late-night snack about a dozen times. They are ridiculously huge, taste delicious (especially the ones containing salmon), and worth every penny. They don't need seating here...it would detract from the bohemian attitude and slow down the place's pulse. I agree with others here that find it's cool to go into the bar next door and have a beer while you enjoy your crepe. Then head upstairs to The Mushroom, one of the last great independent record/CD/DVD/paraphernalia stores on the planet."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"OEOpxiewgI7Sr2de0LVuMg","photo_id":"K-OBFHo_WhqnQkDaJLZ4iQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/K-OBFHo_WhqnQkDaJLZ4iQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9392248392105103},{"business_id":"OEOpxiewgI7Sr2de0LVuMg","photo_id":"kT6mbowdiA0-7bUJbMfh3A","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/kT6mbowdiA0-7bUJbMfh3A.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9237262010574341},{"business_id":"OEOpxiewgI7Sr2de0L